{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_10_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_10",
  "title": "1:11A.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-10",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6e4d9a79729d09088245637aa23f74522f1f7cda826ba34c48b76eafada9767",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠爷爷~！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么是你这小妮子，一个人跑来干嘛啦？灰头土脸的，又钻通风管了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，鼠爷爷，这是大门口的何叔给我的！何叔说我个子小跑得快，一刻钟之内送到就请我吃酸奶！你要给我作证！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，爷爷给你作证。你先去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢爷爷！爷爷再见~！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爷子。怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还记得来找过我们的那几个叙拉古人吗？他们的“家族”已经完全从叙拉古转移到了龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要联系线人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没必要，按兵不动，他们会找上门来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了在这里生存下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可不需要经过任何人的同意，那他们怎么不去和天灾聊聊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天灾要是会说话，兴许就用不着人们窝里斗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——正如您所言，鼠王先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门有自己的规则，魏彦吾在十几年前就默认了这个铁律，我们绝不敢轻易违反。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但您才是执行者，这也是我们今天冒昧来访的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们想铲除企鹅物流，取而代之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们对他们缺乏了解，西西里人。这笔生意你们得不到任何好处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（甘比诺！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在说我们赢不了吗？“鼠王”先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“输赢”不是谈生意的时候应该出现的词，也难怪你逃离了叙拉古，你的确不是那个女人的对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你敢侮辱我的家族？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你闭嘴，甘比诺！我们要的是针对企鹅物流的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要遵循规则，我没有庇护企鹅物流的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——意思是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鹅物流是明面上的合法公司，能庇护他们的只有龙门的钢铁律法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过他们有时候的确触犯了各方面的问题，而且从来不以为然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是切记，西西里人，切记不要越界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另类的秩序不代表没有秩序，叙拉古应当最明白这个道理。可千万别再麻烦我这把老骨头动手了，答应我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......龙门这个季节的星星，比想象中的多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放在桌上的茶，也凉了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是老爷的......喂，上工了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不聋，赶紧打，打完正好去喝早茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来轮到我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正之前也打过招呼了，把弩枪都放下，注意不要误伤到无关人士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......该适应新的规则了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是不是被包了个圆？里三层外三层的那种？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，戚风蛋糕卷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王是贫民窟的话事人，他的爪牙自然无处不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么不早说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为那只是个都市传说，而且我也不知道他真的是只老鼠。谁会这么取外号？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说什么人流密集不好动手，这哪里有什么无辜民众，明明全是敌人嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寸步难行呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直在问怎么办，不如你自己想想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你来了。这里能清楚地看见下面的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的朋友们正陷入苦战，你不打算去帮个忙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可没听说你会下这么重的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不是所有事都会和年轻人推心置腹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是，我总是会忘记，你是个什么样的人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多人会忘记这一点，他们都死无葬身之地。你已经属于特别优待了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你杀了老板，这件事不会这么简单地过去喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，我心里明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鹅物流和他们的主人过于目中无人了，龙门在变化，不能总由着他们为所欲为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们欠缺一个教训，稍微严厉一些的教训。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过河拆桥的事情做多了，会遭到报应的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你借企鹅物流的手做了那么多事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你一开始就打算这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能的吧，你对自己应该扮演的角色拿捏得那么好。嗯，起码比我好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......你真的很聪明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火焰在响应你的意志，你这是打算把我送进墓地里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是非常尊老爱幼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提马！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，能天使，被包围的是我们，不要打乱阵型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁——！稍等！我马上就过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些家伙混在普通市民之间，完全没法好好战斗啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这都是什么和什么啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜松，别发呆啊，你挡着我了！快闪开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每个人都是，各顾各的，就这样该怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然总是这样，那就，各按各的来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听得见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通讯？给谁的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "专心点，空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在的，对吧？一直都在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少爷......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不怪你，多半是父亲多管闲事吧。但是现在，你得帮我一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明白了，少爷请吩咐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼前这仗势，还用吩咐什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他们打飞就完事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然会从少爷的嘴里听到这样的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "容我替老爷问一句，为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我哪管那么多为什么！可颂姐，让一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢噢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撞、撞飞了！？这下不是和我的定位重合了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......就结果而言，老爷应该会满意的，但少爷继续这样......真的不会被企鹅物流带偏吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不能继续妨害少爷了，只要少爷觉得可以，那就可以，嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这小子！乖乖躺下不好吗！一起上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被躲开了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔哦、痛！我的棍子被什么东西打飞了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心，有狙击手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我让开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......虽然是有在控制力度啦，但你一步都没动过，是不是太不讲理了点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站着不动，也不代表自己很轻松啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在龙门真的有什么可以打败你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有啊，“龙门”可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，狡猾的回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是有坚持每天去公园晨练的，上了年纪，保持健康可是很重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晨练会有这种效果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还要加上一点点人生阅历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那两个叙拉古人如何了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真想知道，每天有多少这样见不得光的事情被你悄悄解决了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者说，你让那些企图染指龙门的人自相残杀了多少次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记不清了，孩子。我只记得为了活下去而前仆后继的家伙，远比下水道里的尸体要多，多得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐！我来帮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不许再靠近了。你们几个，去帮老大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮&路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会让你得逞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "狙击？小少爷的保镖吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是个普通的信使，你不该掺和进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信使？没错，我只是个信使。但是我们身后身前的那几位最闹腾的，好像都是信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克萨斯他们和你不一样，现在退出这场战斗，你还能保全自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你说了算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！你还是有点本事的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放手去做就对了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
